        "content": "## 🔑 Credentials Required\n- **Postgres** — product usage, NPS scores, intervention log\n- **Mixpanel API** — engagement data\n- **Zendesk API** — support ticket history\n- **Gmail OAuth2** — check-in email\n- **Calendly API** — CS call booking\n- **ClickUp API** — CS task creation\n- **Slack OAuth2** — account manager escalation"
